<!--
*******************************************************
*******************************************************

          READ ME

*******************************************************

CityGML 2.0 Test dataset "Alderaan"
with Energy ADE 3.0 (beta 8)

Last update: 2026-02-23

This dataset contain several object covering (nearly)
all classes of the Energy ADE.

** CityGML 2.0 **

This file contains objects from classes:
- Building (and BuildingPart), and their thematic surfaces
- SingleVegetationObject
- CityObjectGroup
- CityFurniture
- ReliefFeature, TINRelief

There is a global appearance.

** Energy ADE 3.0 **

At least one object for nearly each class of the Energy ADE
is also available.

** Additional information

To visualise the data and explore the attributes,
you can use the freeware KIT ModelViewer.
You can download it from:

https://www.iai.kit.edu/1302.php

Please be aware that this dataset is intended for
testing purposes, so some attribute values might be
wrong or without any realistic physical meaning.

*******************************************************

This CityGML file was generated by:

Dr. Giorgio Agugiaro
3D Geoinformation group
Delft University of Technology
The Netherlands

https://3d.bk.tudelft.nl/gagugiaro/

*******************************************************
*******************************************************
-->
